{"id":"conferenza","lemma":"conferenza","pos":"noun","rank":1941,"glosses":["conference","lecture"],"ipa":"/kon.feˈrɛn.t͡sa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"conferenze"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-DivoLetto-conferenza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Stasera ci sarà una conferenza stampa.","en":"There's going to be a press conference tonight.","words":[{"g":"this evening, tonight"},{"g":"us / there"},{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"a","l":"uno"},null,{"g":"press"}]},{"text":"La conferenza finisce domani.","en":"The conference ends tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to finish","l":"finire"},{"g":"tomorrow"}]},{"text":"Andrò alla conferenza.","en":"I will go to the meeting.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"andare"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Tom ti vuole in sala conferenze.","en":"Tom wants you in the conference room.","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want","l":"volere"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"room"},null]},{"text":"Hanno in programma una conferenza stampa.","en":"They have scheduled a press conference.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"avere"},null,null,{"g":"a","l":"uno"},null,{"g":"press"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"on the schedule"]]}]}